flowchart LR
  User((User)) --> CDN[/CDN/]
  CDN --> LB{{Load balancer}}
  subgraph app [App tier]
    LB --> W1[Web 1] & W2[Web 2]
  end
  subgraph data [Data tier]
    Cache[(Redis)]
    DB[(Postgres)]
    Q>Job queue]
  end
  W1 & W2 --> Cache
  W1 & W2 --> DB
  W1 & W2 -.-> Q
  Q --> Worker[[Worker]] --> DB
